{
"start": 4595.45,
"end": 4597.49,
"text": " to leave you with one more piece of information."
},
{
"start": 4598.21,
"end": 4608.34,
"text": "Mr. Bashir is quoted as saying, Michael Jackson is a marvelous father to his own children, and I never saw anything that would qualify as a criminal activity."
},
{
"start": 4609.07,
"end": 4611.8,
"text": "This comes from an interview dated just a few days ago."
},
{
"start": 4612.78,
"end": 4614.14,
